factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The reel_script and caption say the meeting was held 'in the municipal office' (நகராட்சி அலுவலகத்தில்) — the article does say the meeting took place at the municipal office, so this is correct; however the slides_spec says 'உடுமலை நகராட்சி அலுவலகத்தில் கலந்தாய்வு கூட்டம்' which is consistent, so no issue here.
  The caption's 'Udumalaipettai rainwater harvesting mandatory' English line and the place name are not in the article, but the article's location is Udumalai, so 'Udumalaipettai' is a slight variant of the place name, not a supported claim.
  The reel_script states the rainwater structures will 'help address future water shortage' (எதிர்கால தண்ணீர் பற்றாக்குறையைச் சமாளிக்கவும்), while the article says the structures are to address water shortage in line with future conditions; this is a reasonable paraphrase, not an invented claim.
  The slides_spec line 'நிலத்தடி நீரை சேமிக்க இது உதவும்' and 'தண்ணீர் பற்றாக்குறையை தீர்க்க இது அவசியம்' says the measure will 'solve' water shortage (தீர்க்க), which overstates the article's wording (நிவர்த்தி செய்வதற்கு ஏற்றவாறு / சமாளிக்க), a stronger claim than the source supports.
